@startuml
autonumber

actor User
participant "UI" as UI
participant "DatabaseDumpAction" as API
participant "AbstractTestService" as Validation
participant "BackupConfigurationService" as Config
participant "PlatformService" as platform
participant "BackupMongodbService" as Backup
participant "StateHolder" as status
participant "RecordsService" as Record
participant "Server/Windows" as Storage

User -> UI: 点击备份按钮
UI -> API: 调用备份接口
API -> Validation: 校验输入
Validation -> Validation: 检查特殊字符 (">", "<", "|", "&")
Validation -> Validation: 检查 remoteAccess 可达性
Validation -> Validation: 检查挂载目录
Validation -> Validation: 检查写权限
Validation -> Validation: 检查磁盘空间
Validation -> API: 校验成功 / 失败

API -> platform: 获取环境配置
Config -> API: 返回数据库用户名、密码、端口、host 等

API -> status: 更新状态为Running
API -> Record: 创建备份记录
API -> Backup: 执行备份
API --> UI: 返回 "备份已启动" (无需等待完成)

... 备份任务在后台执行 ...
Backup -> Storage: 生成 .tmp 临时文件
Backup -> Backup: 加密备份文件
Backup -> Storage: 生成 .db 备份文件
Backup -> Storage: 删除 .tmp 文件
Backup -> status: 更新状态为Completed

loop 轮询 status
    UI -> status: 获取任务状态
    status -> UI: 返回 status

    alt status == "running"
        UI -> status: 继续轮询
    else status == "fail" or "completed"
        UI -> User: 轮询结束
end

@enduml
